==Battleground==
*1 [[Brollow]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*3 [[Pigeon de Sable]]s spawn, delay 1.67 seconds<sup>50f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Owlbrow]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[R.Ost]] spawns as the boss.
**10 [[Brollow]]s spawn, delay 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
**5 [[Brollow]]s spawn, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
**1 [[Duche]] spawns.
**Infinite [[Pigeon de Sable]]s spawn, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
[[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]] can tank all the first part of the stage. Stall until your [[Worker Cat]] is maxed. A Level 30 Octopus Cat can survive around 6 hits from [[Owlbrow]]. Make sure to stack lots of [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Cyborg Cats]] or Ubers (for huge DPS) before hitting the base, because R.Ost has a 200% buff. It is recommended to use the [[Ototo Corps|Slow Beam]] or time the normal [[Cat Cannon]] so that when the base gets hit, the Brollows won't clip inside your units. Make sure that you bring the correct units to deal with the R.Ost, like [[Onmyoji Cat (Rare Cat)|Thaumaturge Cat]], [[Crazed Lizard Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic King Dragon]], and [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Macho Legs]]. <!--reword-->

